  'Allow this app to start automatically in Security → Auto-start.': ['Security → Auto-start में ऐप को अपने आप शुरू होने दें।', 'Security → Auto-start mein app ko automatically start hone dein.'],
  'In app battery saver, choose No restrictions.': ['ऐप के battery saver में No restrictions चुनें।', 'App battery saver mein No restrictions chunein.'],
  'In Other permissions, allow lock-screen and background pop-ups where available.': ['Other permissions में उपलब्ध होने पर lock-screen और background pop-ups की अनुमति दें।', 'Other permissions mein available ho to lock-screen aur background pop-ups allow karein.'],
  'In Battery → Background usage limits, remove this app from Sleeping and Deep sleeping apps. Add it to Never sleeping apps if available.': ['Battery → Background usage limits में ऐप को Sleeping और Deep sleeping apps से हटाएं। उपलब्ध हो तो Never sleeping apps में जोड़ें।', 'Battery → Background usage limits mein app ko Sleeping aur Deep sleeping apps se hatayein. Available ho to Never sleeping apps mein add karein.'],
  'In app battery management, allow auto-launch and background activity where available.': ['ऐप के battery management में उपलब्ध होने पर auto-launch और background activity की अनुमति दें।', 'App battery management mein available ho to auto-launch aur background activity allow karein.'],
  'In iManager → App manager, allow autostart where available.': ['iManager → App manager में उपलब्ध होने पर autostart की अनुमति दें।', 'iManager → App manager mein available ho to autostart allow karein.'],
  'In Background power consumption management, allow this app to run in the background.': ['Background power consumption management में ऐप को बैकग्राउंड में चलने दें।', 'Background power consumption management mein app ko background mein chalne dein.'],
  'In App launch, manage this app manually and allow auto-launch, secondary launch, and background activity.': ['App launch में ऐप को खुद प्रबंधित करें और auto-launch, secondary launch व background activity की अनुमति दें।', 'App launch mein app manually manage karein aur auto-launch, secondary launch aur background activity allow karein.'],
